**A smaller practice with time for you**

Ankersted Psychology Practice is located in Behandlerhuset at Niels Ebbesens Gade 4, 9000 Aalborg.

Ankersted is a part-time practice. That means I see fewer clients at a time and can create space and calm around each course of therapy.

For me it matters that there is room for presence and depth—and that therapy can follow what is important for you.

## Fees

Individual session: DKK 1,050, 50 minutes.

Supervision: DKK 1,150, 60 minutes.

## Subsidies

In many cases it is possible to use a health insurance policy that you or your employer have taken out.

Sygeforsikringen Danmark provides subsidies for psychological help from an authorised psychologist. For children and young people under 18, the subsidy is available regardless of the issue. For adults, subsidies are granted according to a set of criteria. You can read more about conditions and subsidies at: [www.sygeforsikring.dk](https://www.sygeforsikring.dk)

I do not have an agreement with the public health insurance scheme.

## Cancellations

Cancellations must be given no later than the day before the scheduled appointment. You can cancel by phone on 50390064 or by email at kontakt@ankersted.dk

Late cancellations or no-shows are charged at half the session fee.

## Confidentiality

As a member of the Danish Psychological Association, I am subject to the Danish Psychologists Act. I am bound by confidentiality and work according to ethical guidelines that ensure you receive safe care.
